<title>USA: MBIA has capacity for NY State appropriation bonds.</title>
<headline>MBIA has capacity for NY State appropriation bonds.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>MBIA Insurance Corp said Tuesday it has some remaining secondary market insurance for New York State annual appropriation debt.</p>
<p>Capacity is available on a first-come, first-served basis. For more information, call 800-624-2669.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
